<title>NEW ZEALAND: Franklin ups FCL Energy stake to 7.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Franklin ups FCL Energy stake to 7.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc has increased its relevant interest in the voting securities of Fletcher Challenge Energy to 7.66 percent from 5.13 percent, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
